      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Una historia antigua dice que las plantas fueron las primeras en empujar.",
          "en": "One old story says the plants were the first to push."
        },
        {
          "es": "Abrieron sus hojas planas y se apoyaron contra las nubes.",
          "en": "They spread their leaves flat, and leaned against the clouds."
        },
        {
          "es": "Centímetro a centímetro, levantaron el cielo, hasta que la gente pudo arrastrarse entre cielo y tierra.",
          "en": "Inch by inch, they lifted the sky, until people could crawl between sky and earth."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero arrastrarse no es caminar. La gente quería ponerse de pie y ver lejos.",
          "en": "But crawling is not walking. People wanted to stand tall and see far."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces, dicen las historias hawaianas, llegó un hombre. Se dice que era Māui.",
          "en": "Then, the Hawaiian stories say, a man came along. He is said to be Māui."
        }
      ],
