      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Aun hoy, nubes oscuras bajan a veces por las laderas de Haleakalā, la gran montaña de Māui.",
          "en": "Even now, dark clouds sometimes sink low on the slopes of Haleakalā, Māui’s great mountain."
        },
        {
          "es": "Traen lluvia fuerte a una colina llamada Kauiki.",
          "en": "They bring heavy rain to a hill called Kauiki."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero la historia dice que nunca se atreven a quedarse. Temen que Māui venga y las arroje lejos.",
          "en": "But the old story says they never dare to stay. They fear Māui will come and hurl them away."
        },
        {
          "es": "Haleakalā significa «casa del sol». Recuerda ese nombre.",
          "en": "Haleakalā means “house of the sun.” Remember that name."
        }
      ],
